script refused a run in which there was no extension left to measure.  Pinned to `e61ccd8^`.  *** THE SHAPE IS 
SPECIFIC AND WORTH NAMING: a round's artifacts are written while the round is UNCOMMITTED, so every relative ref in 
them is written from a vantage point the round itself destroys by shipping. ***  The artifact is durable; the 
reference frame is not.  **BOTH WERE CAUGHT BY THE SCRIPTS' OWN GUARDS, NOT BY A READER**, and that is the reassuring 
half: each refused to measure rather than measuring the wrong thing.  A reproduction months from now would fail loudly 
