existence-only, forward-only from a cutoff.  **NOT built in the round that found it** -- a tooling change owing two 
negative controls (it must fire on a relative ref and must NOT fire on a pinned SHA), which ships as its own harness 
round.  *The population is probably larger: only two files were exercised today.  Other rounds' artifacts have never 
been re-run, so a stale ref there would not yet have announced itself.  The count is unknown and is deliberately not 
