lca_confwidth_probe.py    NOT REFERENCED BY ANY GATE    (lcaconfwidth, MED)\n    alpha_pfnoffset_probe.py  NOT 
REFERENCED BY ANY GATE    (alphapfnoffset, **HIGH**)\n    alpha_harness_probe.py    NOT REFERENCED BY ANY GATE    
(alphaswpctxptbr, **HIGH**)\n  -- against the wired controls in the same batch: sh_iprbcd_probe.py, 
sgi_re_rgb_probe.py, gdrom_default_probe.py and diff_wdc_identify.c all ARE referenced.  `run.sh` runs an explicit 
