and is why it lands here rather than as a fresh row:** `check_probe_wiring.py` already classifies all four as 
`CLASS_WITNESS` -- correctly, by the ladder's witness/detector timing line -- and its own entry for 
`lca_confbus_probe.py` says *\"but this probe RUNS IN NO GATE, so the coverage exists and is never executed: 
wiringcliff\"*. *** BUT THAT CHECKER IS UNCOMMITTED, so **nothing in any committed tree reports this today.** ***  The 
four closures are HONEST -- their `witness:` says `probe:`, which is exactly what it is -- and what is absent is 
STANDING DEFENCE.  The seat's disposition, adopted: this belongs in each round record as a DISCLOSED RESIDUAL on those 
four rows, not only as one filed id, because a reader of `alphapfnoffset` alone cannot see it.  *** SCOPE NOTE FROM 
THE FABLE ADJUDICATION, 2026-09-17: MAKE SURE THE FOUR `CLASS_WITNESS` PROBES ARE IN THIS ROW'S SCOPE, NOT ONLY THE 
DATED EXEMPTIONS. ***  This row's own title is about the EXEMPT table expiring, and the four unwired witnesses 
(`lca_confbus_probe.py`, `lca_confwidth_probe.py`, `alpha_pfnoffset_probe.py`, `alpha_harness_probe.py`) are a 
different population -- classified `CLASS_WITNESS`, never exempted, simply never run. *** AND A TRAP THAT WOULD BITE 
THE FIX: `lca_confwidth_probe.py` MUST NOT BE WIRED AS-IS. ***  It scores **2/6 at HEAD** (measured 2026-09-17, 
`regress/artifacts/lcaconfwidth/head_20260917/`) because `#518` replaced the IOC_CONF kill with a decline.  Wiring it 
produces a PHANTOM RED; the remedy there is RE-PIN OR RETIRE, under the oracle-correction rule's order -- re-pin 
first, measure the committed build red under the new expectations, then change anything. **AND THE COMMITTED TREE 
ALREADY KNOWS**, which sharpens the gap rather than excusing it: `check_probe_wiring.py` carries all four as 
`CLASS_WITNESS` with their scores.  *The gap is the FAILING, not the knowing* -- the checker deliberately does not 
fail on that class.  *** OWNER DECISION 2026-09-17: STAGGER -- wire the cheap ones, re-date the rest with SEPARATED 
