     "title": "dev_sgi_ip30.c aborts the host on a guest load OR store at 0x0ff10020 on the advertised -E sgi -e ip30, 
and the read arm zeroes the ISR before dying; a fourth abort() is armed by a LEGAL imask0 write and fires from 
