generalise.  Recorded as such rather than left looking systemic. ***  AND THE COUPLING WAS HANDLED IN THE SAFE ORDER, 
which is worth keeping because the unsafe one was live: mapping the landisk register WHILE the predicate still 
triggered on 0x08 would have latched COMMAND_RESET on SIX routine Device Control writes per probe (a seat measured 
