4240:     pre-fix HEAD   + OLD oracle        11/18    the three txt rows PASS
4241:     pre-fix clone  + RE-PINNED oracle   8/18    the three txt rows FAIL   <- the red
4242:     post-fix       + RE-PINNED oracle  18/18
4243: 
4244: **THESE THREE ARE THE 18-ROW INSTRUMENT AND THEY STAY AS THEY ARE.** They are not the round's
4245: headline figures -- those are 8/21 and 21/21 above -- they are the ORDER PROOF for the oracle
4246: correction, and an order proof is a statement about three runs of ONE instrument at one moment.
4247: Re-measuring them on the 21-row form would not strengthen it and would quietly destroy the only
4248: evidence that the re-pin preceded the code change.
