4419: disclosed with its apparatus reason — **but only after being measured unbuildable.** Measured,
4420: counting ticks by the unconditional `reg_0x20000 += 1000`:
4421: 
4422:     step 1 / 2 / 3 / 8 / 1000  ->  ONE tick
4423:     step 65536 / 70000         ->  TWO
